      <description align="center" color="red" colored="true" height="398" resized="true" width="250" x="22" y="138">Trigger service&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Naveen kumar&lt;br&gt;Karthik Sanagapalli&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overview:This Pipeline is a composite of check_for_new_run, Execute_Energy_Optimization and update_database blocks. It examines the last run time of a particular case and the associated frequency to establish the next consecutive run time. It gathers output from Energy_Optimization pipeline, as applicable, and then records all required information in the database output tables&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <description align="center" color="green" colored="true" height="392" resized="true" width="332" x="272" y="140"/>
